Package: fastEukaryotyping
Type: Package
Title: Fast C++ Eukaryotyping MLST Distance Ensemble
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Angel Luis", "Robles Fernandez",
           email = "a.l.robles.fernandez@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4674-4270"))
Description: Fast C++17/Rcpp reimplementation of the Eukaryotyping
    ensemble (Bayesian and heuristic genetic distances) for MLST haplotype
    data sheets. Handles missing data, heterozygosity and mixed-genotype
    infections. The methods were first described by Barratt et al. (2019)
    <doi:10.1017/S0031182019000581>.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/alrobles/fastEukaryotyping
BugReports: https://github.com/alrobles/fastEukaryotyping/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    RcppParallel,
    checkmate
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppParallel
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: C++17, GNU make
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Encoding: UTF-8
